flowchart TD
    S01[S01 Intake: item and intent] --> S02[S02 Item and commercial data]
    S02 --> S03{S03 Regulatory screen}
    S03 -- BLOCKED --> X1[Closed: BLOCKED_REGULATORY, alternatives offered]
    S03 -- proceed --> S04[S04 Intake: offer details, completeness, cut-off]
    S04 --> S05[S05 Funding recognition]
    S05 -. evidence needed .-> U1((Promotion Owner uploads letter))
    U1 -.-> S05
    S05 --> S06[S06 Calendar conflict and frequency]
    S06 --> S07[S07 Reference price and claims]
    S07 --> S08[S08 Promotion economics]
    S08 --> S09[S09 Supply readiness]
    S09 --> S10[S10 Setup feasibility - Pricing Ops pre-check]
    S10 --> S11[S11 Approval routing - band, escalations, delegation, SoD]
    S11 --> S12[S12 Decision pack and approvals]
    S12 --> F[Finance review - Band B+]
    S12 --> A[Approver decision]
    S12 --> G1[Compliance gate]
    S12 --> G2[Supply Chain gate]
    S12 --> G3[Cut-off exception]
    F --> A
    A -- approved --> S13[S13 Post-approval setup - simulated PromoHub draft]
    A -- returned / rejected --> X2[RETURNED_FOR_REVISION / REJECTED]
    G1 --> S13
    G2 --> S13
    G3 --> S13
    S13 --> S14[S14 Completion and handover]
    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b58900
    class U1,F,A,G1,G2,G3 human
